multiflexi-tui (3.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite in C++ with Turbo Vision (replaces Go/Bubbletea frontend).
  * Shell out to multiflexi-cli --format=json for all operations.
  * Entity browsers for companies, applications, run templates, jobs, tasks,
    credentials, tokens, users, artifacts, credential types/prototypes,
    company-apps, queue, event sources/rules, and GDPR deletion requests.
  * Activation and credential wizards; live job stdout/stderr streaming.
  * Admin helpers: encryption status, prune, job/task/queue metrics,
    telemetry test, application JSON import/validate.

